<title>ROMANIA: Turnover on Bucharest bourse up, prices mixed.</title>
<headline>Turnover on Bucharest bourse up, prices mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>1230 GMT - Bucharest stocks closed mixed on Thursday, while turnover rose to 92,04 million lei from 66.2 million lei in the previous session.</p>
<p>* Azomures SA fertiliser maker took the bulk of</p>
<p>trading but its prices fell under strong selling pressure.</p>
